  "ruleText": "Int 101.10 \"Nonfeasance\" means, in pertaining to the duties of the board, when a board member misses 3 board meetings during one calendar year.\n\nSource. #7851, eff 3-12-03; ss by #9942, INTERIM, eff 6-18-11, EXPIRED: 12-15-11\n\nNew. #10040-A, eff 12-16-11 (from Int 101.09)",
